WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.520
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:10.790 --> 00:12.230
I've already found a lead.

3
00:13.760 --> 00:14.530
It won't take long.

4
00:16.080 --> 00:17.010
Just wait a bit longer.

5
00:19.880 --> 00:20.860
It won't take long.

6
00:24.960 --> 00:25.420
Honey,

7
00:26.920 --> 00:27.810
I can't wait any longer.

8
00:28.080 --> 00:29.740
I won't let you lie to me again.

9
00:30.080 --> 00:30.810
Xiangyuan,

10
00:31.470 --> 00:32.010
no.

11
00:33.480 --> 00:34.460
No, Xiangyuan.

12
00:54.710 --> 00:55.330
Cheng Kong...

13
00:55.960 --> 00:56.970
Cheng Kong has been searching

14
00:56.990 --> 00:57.950
for the source of the well water.

15
00:58.960 --> 00:59.900
The villagers

16
01:00.160 --> 01:01.770
always thought Xiangyuan and Cheng Kong

17
01:01.990 --> 01:02.710
weren't right for each other.

18
01:02.750 --> 01:05.650
So she drugged Cheng Kong

19
01:06.910 --> 01:08.220
and got pregnant with his child.

20
01:08.670 --> 01:09.730
Let's stop here, Yamao.

21
01:10.750 --> 01:11.750
I'll find the rabbit demon.

22
01:11.750 --> 01:12.370
No.

23
01:13.470 --> 01:14.860
We've tried everything.

24
01:15.080 --> 01:16.220
This is the only way that works.

25
01:16.440 --> 01:17.140
Qi Fengyin.

26
01:17.800 --> 01:18.580
Now is not the time

27
01:18.600 --> 01:19.500
to feel sorry for me.

28
01:52.860 --> 01:58.740
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

29
02:00.780 --> 02:06.740
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

30
02:07.780 --> 02:12.020
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

31
02:15.700 --> 02:23.260
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

32
02:23.620 --> 02:30.380
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

33
02:31.620 --> 02:38.260
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

34
02:39.460 --> 02:46.300
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

35
02:47.900 --> 02:54.420
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

36
02:59.180 --> 03:00.980
[Blossom in Darkness]

37
03:00.980 --> 03:02.980
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

38
03:02.980 --> 03:05.980
[Episode 8]

39
03:08.480 --> 03:09.740
Take care in daily life.

40
03:10.150 --> 03:11.250
Eat simple foods.

41
03:11.710 --> 03:12.690
Listen to soothing music.

42
03:13.040 --> 03:14.460
Keep the eyes from evil deeds.

43
03:14.670 --> 03:15.970
And the ears from wicked words.

44
03:16.710 --> 03:17.570
My precious child,

45
03:18.920 --> 03:20.370
you'll be born

46
03:20.430 --> 03:21.690
safe and healthy.

47
04:24.350 --> 04:25.660
The rabbit demon ran to Cheng Kong's house!

48
04:25.760 --> 04:26.420
Hurry! After it!

49
04:35.150 --> 04:35.540
Xiangyuan.

50
04:36.560 --> 04:36.980
Xiangyuan.

51
04:39.000 --> 04:39.420
Xiangyuan.

52
04:41.120 --> 04:41.540
Xiangyuan.

53
04:52.270 --> 04:52.860
Honey.

54
04:56.560 --> 04:57.130
Xiangyuan.

55
05:01.000 --> 05:01.540
There, there.

56
05:02.390 --> 05:03.100
It's all right.

57
05:05.200 --> 05:05.770
I'm sorry.

58
05:07.710 --> 05:08.740
I shouldn't have kept this from you.

59
05:10.270 --> 05:11.860
I didn't want you to get pregnant

60
05:12.830 --> 05:14.740
because you're a demon.

61
05:16.390 --> 05:17.770
Just staying in human form

62
05:18.000 --> 05:19.060
is hard enough for you.

63
05:20.080 --> 05:21.330
Only the well water

64
05:21.790 --> 05:24.060
can suppress your vicious demonic nature

65
05:24.830 --> 05:25.690
and make you forget

66
05:25.710 --> 05:27.100
that you're a demon.

67
05:40.790 --> 05:41.420
Xiangyuan.

68
05:42.030 --> 05:43.770
I've found the source of the mystical spring.

69
05:45.200 --> 05:46.100
Don't be afraid.

70
05:47.080 --> 05:47.660
We found it!

71
05:47.880 --> 05:49.310
The rabbit demon is hiding in this house!

72
05:49.760 --> 05:50.810
The people who went missing while hunting

73
05:50.960 --> 05:52.500
might have been killed by it, too!

74
05:52.550 --> 05:53.620
We have to kill it!

75
05:54.000 --> 05:54.740
Honey.

76
05:54.830 --> 05:56.010
- Kill it! - Kill it!

77
05:56.010 --> 05:56.450
Xiangyuan.

78
05:57.200 --> 05:57.860
Don't be afraid.

79
05:58.480 --> 05:59.200
Kill it!

80
05:59.200 --> 06:00.500
I won't let you suffer anymore.

81
06:03.710 --> 06:04.370
This jade pendant

82
06:05.120 --> 06:06.560
will let me switch forms with you.

83
06:07.280 --> 06:08.080
Kill it!

84
06:09.270 --> 06:10.060
Kill it!

85
06:10.790 --> 06:11.540
Kill it!

86
06:12.030 --> 06:12.740
Kill it!

87
06:15.120 --> 06:15.890
Kill it!

88
06:17.440 --> 06:18.130
Kill it!

89
06:19.470 --> 06:20.210
Kill it!

90
06:28.200 --> 06:28.860
Kill it!

91
06:29.560 --> 06:30.330
Kill it!

92
06:30.470 --> 06:31.330
Kill it!

93
06:31.710 --> 06:32.450
Kill it!

94
06:33.640 --> 06:34.330
Kill it!

95
06:35.080 --> 06:35.770
Kill it!

96
06:36.350 --> 06:37.100
Kill it!

97
06:37.390 --> 06:38.130
Kill it!

98
06:38.320 --> 06:39.100
Kill it!

99
06:50.390 --> 06:51.180
Honey.

100
06:57.710 --> 06:58.330
Honey.

101
07:03.680 --> 07:04.500
No!

102
07:07.520 --> 07:08.450
Cheng Kong!

103
07:09.270 --> 07:10.060
Cheng Kong!

104
07:12.520 --> 07:14.130
Cheng Kong, no!

105
07:15.710 --> 07:16.210
There he is!

106
07:16.270 --> 07:16.940
After him!

107
07:19.060 --> 07:19.890
Kill him!

108
07:40.120 --> 07:40.840
Xiangyuan...

109
07:41.440 --> 07:42.880
Xiangyuan is the rabbit demon.

110
07:44.910 --> 07:46.500
Then why can't we sense her demonic aura?

111
07:48.760 --> 07:50.800
Because Cheng Kong used the jade pendant

112
07:50.800 --> 07:52.170
to switch forms with Xiangyuan.

113
07:52.590 --> 07:53.300
The villagers

114
07:54.000 --> 07:55.500
mistook Cheng Kong for the rabbit demon

115
07:55.520 --> 07:56.190
and attacked him.

116
07:58.030 --> 08:00.420
It's Xiangyuan who's controlling the villagers.

117
08:03.350 --> 08:04.860
Wait. Let me take another look.

118
08:14.320 --> 08:14.940
My Lord!

119
08:15.680 --> 08:16.770
My Lord, something's wrong!

120
08:17.120 --> 08:18.660
Whenever Xiangyuan is separated from this pendant,

121
08:18.680 --> 08:19.980
she starts acting very strangely.

122
08:21.200 --> 08:22.770
This jade pendant suppresses her demonic power.

123
08:23.390 --> 08:24.400
Without it,

124
08:24.640 --> 08:25.860
she could lose control.

125
08:26.150 --> 08:27.210
She's the rabbit demon?

126
08:28.000 --> 08:29.370
Should I give it back to her, then?

127
08:47.080 --> 08:48.660
Why have they become so violent?

128
08:49.560 --> 08:50.610
What just happened?

129
09:23.870 --> 09:24.300
Yamao!

130
09:31.560 --> 09:33.780
That blow knocked some sense into me.

131
09:36.710 --> 09:37.810
Are you hurt anywhere?

132
09:39.990 --> 09:40.660
I'm fine.

133
09:41.960 --> 09:42.420
Look.

134
09:42.680 --> 09:43.400
I kept your flower

135
09:43.400 --> 09:44.300
perfectly safe.

136
09:44.680 --> 09:45.410
So?

137
09:45.510 --> 09:46.690
Does this make up for

138
09:46.690 --> 09:48.090
pushing you into Eerie Cavern?

139
10:03.470 --> 10:04.090
Xiangyuan.

140
10:04.160 --> 10:05.060
Cheng Kong can still be saved.

141
10:05.080 --> 10:05.660
Shut up!

142
10:06.960 --> 10:07.780
I finally

143
10:07.780 --> 10:09.090
have my husband back.

144
10:10.160 --> 10:12.060
I won't let you ruin it!

145
10:16.590 --> 10:17.380
Go find Cheng Kong.

146
10:25.830 --> 10:26.540
Yamao.

147
10:26.750 --> 10:27.780
Qi Fengyin.

148
10:28.990 --> 10:30.540
He slipped this to me just now.

149
10:31.110 --> 10:31.780
What's going on?

150
10:32.440 --> 10:34.660
I saw that Xiangyuan is the rabbit demon.

151
10:34.870 --> 10:36.330
Cheng Kong used this magical pendant

152
10:36.350 --> 10:37.540
to swap bodies with her.

153
10:39.630 --> 10:41.180
Qi Fengyin is holding Xiangyuan off.

154
10:41.440 --> 10:42.610
I'm going to find Cheng Kong.

155
10:42.680 --> 10:43.900
Only he can bring Xiangyuan back to her senses.

156
10:45.080 --> 10:46.060
Calm down.

157
10:46.080 --> 10:46.830
Now that we know

158
10:46.830 --> 10:47.850
Xiangyuan is behind all this,

159
10:48.040 --> 10:48.980
I can kill her right now

160
10:49.080 --> 10:50.000
and end this demonic threat.

161
10:51.130 --> 10:52.450
She's the one who cast the spell.

162
10:52.680 --> 10:53.330
If you kill her,

163
10:53.560 --> 10:54.610
what will happen to the villagers?

164
11:00.660 --> 11:01.680
Stay here and guard this place.

165
11:01.830 --> 11:02.900
Don't let those mindless husks

166
11:02.920 --> 11:04.020
get anywhere near Qi Fengyin again.

167
11:04.110 --> 11:04.940
I'll be back as soon as I can.

168
11:21.710 --> 11:22.380
Honey.

169
11:24.280 --> 11:25.260
Let me out.

170
11:26.750 --> 11:28.210
I'll get rid of anyone

171
11:28.230 --> 11:29.330
who tries to keep us apart.

172
11:30.400 --> 11:31.300
I'm not your husband.

173
11:36.230 --> 11:37.540
Back then, you lost control of your demonic power.

174
11:38.200 --> 11:39.730
You turned into a rabbit demon and devoured living creatures.

175
11:40.110 --> 11:41.210
Cheng Kong used a magical artifact

176
11:41.230 --> 11:42.380
to exchange his human form for yours.

177
11:44.560 --> 11:46.180
That allowed you to stay human.

178
11:46.870 --> 11:48.420
But he became the rabbit demon instead.

179
11:55.320 --> 11:58.210
- Kill it! - Hurry! Kill it!

180
11:59.040 --> 12:00.730
- Kill it! - Kill it!

181
12:03.110 --> 12:04.210
Don't hurt him!

182
12:05.080 --> 12:05.660
No!

183
12:05.750 --> 12:07.340
Please, don't hurt him! I'm begging you!

184
12:07.350 --> 12:08.090
No! No!

185
12:08.160 --> 12:09.300
Please, I'm begging you!

186
12:09.510 --> 12:10.900
No! Please, no!

187
12:11.800 --> 12:12.610
Get out of the way!

188
12:15.230 --> 12:16.810
- Kill it! - Kill it!

189
12:19.080 --> 12:21.060
No! No!

190
12:21.930 --> 12:23.440
- Kill it! - Kill it!

191
12:23.510 --> 12:24.610
Cheng Kong!

192
12:25.400 --> 12:27.180
Please, I'm begging you!

193
12:28.350 --> 12:28.850
No!

194
12:28.870 --> 12:29.610
Kill it!

195
12:31.080 --> 12:31.570
No!

196
12:31.590 --> 12:32.570
Hurry! Kill it!

197
12:32.920 --> 12:34.450
- Yes! Kill it! - Kill it!

198
12:35.330 --> 12:36.020
Kill it!

199
12:36.800 --> 12:37.940
Cheng Kong! Cheng...

200
12:57.510 --> 12:58.180
No!

201
12:59.080 --> 12:59.850
No!

202
13:01.990 --> 13:03.780
I hate you all!

203
13:35.160 --> 13:36.610
They despise rabbit demons.

204
13:38.470 --> 13:40.690
So I'll make them

205
13:41.160 --> 13:43.020
turn into monsters like me every night

206
13:43.750 --> 13:45.900
and devour every living thing.

207
13:48.230 --> 13:49.970
I'll put a curse on them!

208
13:51.200 --> 13:53.020
They'll never be reborn.

209
13:54.080 --> 13:55.090
They'll never find peace.

210
13:58.080 --> 13:59.450
You've never truly

211
13:59.470 --> 14:00.780
cared about someone, have you?

212
14:01.510 --> 14:02.900
Otherwise, you'd know

213
14:03.230 --> 14:04.780
there's no way I'll stop.

214
14:05.400 --> 14:06.420
If you try to stop me,

215
14:07.560 --> 14:08.690
you'll die, too!

216
14:13.830 --> 14:15.610
Cheng Kong! Cheng Kong!

217
14:19.160 --> 14:20.070
I know everything

218
14:20.070 --> 14:20.900
about your past!

219
14:21.110 --> 14:22.370
If you want to bring Xiangyuan back

220
14:23.110 --> 14:24.140
and put an end to this chaos,

221
14:24.440 --> 14:25.780
then stop hiding in fear!

222
14:26.280 --> 14:26.900
Otherwise...

223
14:59.200 --> 15:00.260
I admit, I don't know

224
15:01.230 --> 15:03.180
what it means to truly care about someone.

225
15:05.080 --> 15:06.210
But there's one thing I do know.

226
15:07.510 --> 15:08.780
When you lose something precious,

227
15:09.590 --> 15:11.210
you do whatever it takes to get it back.

228
15:11.800 --> 15:13.060
I'll find the rabbit demon

229
15:13.440 --> 15:14.300
and get the soul crystal back.

230
15:15.350 --> 15:16.300
If it goes into hiding,

231
15:17.040 --> 15:18.540
I'll turn this whole mountain upside down.

232
15:19.510 --> 15:20.940
If it's swallowed the crystal,

233
15:21.200 --> 15:22.490
I'll cut its belly open.

234
15:23.800 --> 15:24.970
As long as there's the slightest hope,

235
15:25.680 --> 15:26.970
I won't give up on saving my master.

236
15:29.630 --> 15:30.300
Xiangyuan,

237
15:31.280 --> 15:32.420
have you ever tried

238
15:32.440 --> 15:33.260
to find him all these years?

239
15:35.400 --> 15:36.380
With all your demonic power,

240
15:36.400 --> 15:37.420
have you ever thought of saving him?

241
15:38.510 --> 15:39.730
Or do you really think

242
15:40.870 --> 15:42.300
this revenge matters more to you

243
15:42.920 --> 15:44.260
than Cheng Kong?

244
15:46.990 --> 15:47.900
You're only saying this

245
15:48.830 --> 15:50.300
to trick me into stopping.

246
15:51.080 --> 15:52.850
These people made me suffer so much.

247
15:53.920 --> 15:55.420
How could I ever let them go?

248
15:55.680 --> 15:57.690
Wasn't it all because you let others turn you against him?

249
15:58.960 --> 16:00.690
You keep saying you love Cheng Kong.

250
16:01.680 --> 16:02.850
Then why wouldn't you trust him?

251
16:18.920 --> 16:20.540
I was the one who didn't trust him.

252
16:24.560 --> 16:25.450
I was afraid.

253
16:27.960 --> 16:29.300
He never looked down on me.

254
16:31.800 --> 16:33.090
But the better he treated me,

255
16:34.320 --> 16:37.180
the more I feared I couldn't handle his love.

256
16:39.630 --> 16:41.490
So I grew suspicious

257
16:42.080 --> 16:43.570
and let others turn me against him.

258
16:47.560 --> 16:48.540
Could it be

259
16:50.470 --> 16:52.210
that I ruined everything myself?

260
17:18.160 --> 17:18.660
Xiangyuan!

261
17:27.120 --> 17:27.690
Xiangyuan.

262
17:28.360 --> 17:28.970
Xiangyuan.

263
17:30.070 --> 17:30.730
It's me.

264
17:51.230 --> 17:52.420
I've brought Cheng Kong back.

265
18:06.120 --> 18:06.690
Listen,

266
18:06.790 --> 18:07.690
that gust of wind just now...

267
18:13.880 --> 18:15.530
You said you'd come back

268
18:15.600 --> 18:16.580
when the morning glories bloomed.

269
18:17.640 --> 18:19.250
But no matter how long I waited,

270
18:19.270 --> 18:20.620
you never came.

271
18:24.470 --> 18:25.010
Xiangyuan.

272
18:25.600 --> 18:26.250
I'm sorry.

273
18:28.310 --> 18:29.770
I was lucky enough to survive,

274
18:31.270 --> 18:32.620
but I turned into a demon beast

275
18:33.070 --> 18:34.620
and could never take human form again.

276
18:36.840 --> 18:38.660
By then, you'd already lost control

277
18:39.640 --> 18:41.140
and created this dream for yourself.

278
18:42.160 --> 18:43.250
I was afraid that showing up

279
18:43.960 --> 18:45.250
would shatter the peace you'd found.

280
18:46.710 --> 18:47.690
I'm sorry, Xiangyuan.

281
18:48.200 --> 18:49.050
It's all my fault.

282
18:56.030 --> 18:57.010
Were you afraid

283
18:57.470 --> 18:59.050
I'd remember everything,

284
19:00.200 --> 19:01.450
suffer even more,

285
19:02.600 --> 19:04.420
and do something I could never undo?

286
19:05.880 --> 19:07.100
If only I'd spent that time

287
19:07.790 --> 19:09.140
thinking about finding you

288
19:10.360 --> 19:11.490
instead of seeking revenge,

289
19:12.960 --> 19:14.970
would things have turned out differently?

290
19:24.710 --> 19:25.340
Honey.

291
19:26.230 --> 19:27.900
I can't keep dragging you into this.

292
19:29.160 --> 19:30.450
Everyone in this village

293
19:30.470 --> 19:32.290
has been transformed by my demonic power.

294
19:33.550 --> 19:34.770
And I'm the only one

295
19:36.880 --> 19:37.820
who can undo it.

296
19:37.840 --> 19:39.050
Xiangyuan, what are you doing?

297
19:46.840 --> 19:47.340
Xiangyuan!

298
19:47.920 --> 19:48.250
Xiangyuan!

299
19:49.510 --> 19:49.940
Xiangyuan!

300
19:52.940 --> 19:56.340
♪So many longings...♪

301
19:57.400 --> 19:58.140
Honey.

302
19:59.840 --> 20:01.940
I can't stay with you anymore.

303
20:03.790 --> 20:04.450
Xiangyuan!

304
20:05.270 --> 20:06.340
Xiangyuan, no!

305
20:06.400 --> 20:07.010
Xiangyuan!

306
20:08.510 --> 20:09.940
I failed to protect you.

307
20:11.360 --> 20:12.690
Xiangyuan, don't leave me!

308
20:12.710 --> 20:13.420
Xiangyuan!

309
20:13.960 --> 20:14.730
Xiangyuan!

310
20:15.790 --> 20:17.210
There has to be another way!

311
20:18.030 --> 20:19.450
Please don't leave me!

312
20:20.360 --> 20:21.770
I failed to protect you.

313
20:21.840 --> 20:22.530
Xiangyuan.

314
20:23.270 --> 20:24.140
Xiangyuan...

315
20:24.790 --> 20:25.690
Xiangyuan!

316
20:28.540 --> 20:31.420
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever...♪

317
20:31.440 --> 20:32.450
Xiangyuan!

318
20:34.230 --> 20:35.820
Xiangyuan!

319
20:36.660 --> 20:40.500
♪Still waits to come true♪

320
20:41.060 --> 20:45.100
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

321
20:45.540 --> 20:49.140
♪I'll stay by your side♪

322
20:49.580 --> 20:53.140
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

323
20:53.620 --> 20:55.980
♪When the dream ends...♪

324
20:57.270 --> 20:57.970
Xiangyuan.

325
21:01.070 --> 21:02.900
Consider it repayment for saving my life.

326
21:38.920 --> 21:39.940
Please let us in!

327
21:40.710 --> 21:41.210
Let us in!

328
21:41.230 --> 21:42.210
We have something urgent to report!

329
21:42.470 --> 21:43.530
We need to see Master Du!

330
21:43.710 --> 21:44.180
That's right!

331
21:44.920 --> 21:45.710
- You two... - Let us in!

332
21:45.880 --> 21:47.180
The master can't see anyone today.

333
21:47.550 --> 21:48.810
- Why not? - Please leave.

334
21:48.810 --> 21:50.340
We must see Master Du today!

335
21:50.470 --> 21:51.210
If we can't see him today,

336
21:51.400 --> 21:52.010
we're not leaving!

337
21:52.030 --> 21:52.620
What's going on?

338
21:52.920 --> 21:53.970
What's all this noise?

339
21:55.680 --> 21:56.210
Yinhua.

340
21:56.510 --> 21:57.420
These two immortal sect disciples

341
21:57.510 --> 21:58.540
just barged into Mount Zhaowu.

342
21:58.540 --> 21:59.990
They say they have accusations against Hao.

343
22:01.200 --> 22:02.100
Nonsense.

344
22:03.200 --> 22:04.420
I'll handle this.

345
22:04.920 --> 22:05.580
You may leave.

346
22:05.960 --> 22:06.380
Yes.

347
22:09.990 --> 22:11.970
What brings you two here?

348
22:12.160 --> 22:13.140
We need to see Master Du.

349
22:13.790 --> 22:14.690
We have something urgent to report.

350
22:14.990 --> 22:16.690
My master leads the Five Great Sects.

351
22:17.160 --> 22:18.690
You can't just demand to see him.

352
22:19.710 --> 22:20.820
If you wish to see him,

353
22:21.200 --> 22:22.250
you must first tell me

354
22:22.440 --> 22:23.380
what this is about.

355
22:23.710 --> 22:25.050
Yuwen Hao, Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple,

356
22:25.310 --> 22:26.450
has been protecting that demon Yamao.

357
22:26.550 --> 22:27.250
He's betrayed his sect

358
22:27.510 --> 22:28.100
and turned against the immortal realm...

359
22:28.120 --> 22:28.600
Shut up!

360
22:30.680 --> 22:32.380
How dare you come to Mount Zhaowu and spread lies

361
22:32.840 --> 22:33.900
to slander Hao.

362
22:34.470 --> 22:35.620
You've got some nerve!

363
22:35.680 --> 22:36.660
We swear on our lives

364
22:36.920 --> 22:37.860
that every word is true.

365
22:45.990 --> 22:47.940
Please, calm down, both of you.

366
22:48.270 --> 22:50.530
This concerns Mount Zhaowu's reputation.

367
22:51.070 --> 22:52.140
We have to be careful.

368
22:53.440 --> 22:55.900
Please come with me so we can talk privately.

369
22:57.270 --> 22:57.770
This way, please.

370
23:11.920 --> 23:13.450
I've caused you all so much trouble.

371
23:13.880 --> 23:14.580
I'm truly sorry.

372
23:15.790 --> 23:16.860
If you're really sorry,

373
23:17.270 --> 23:18.490
then give me my master's soul crystal

374
23:18.510 --> 23:19.420
before you say anything else.

375
23:31.070 --> 23:32.580
You'd better keep it safe this time.

376
23:32.920 --> 23:33.860
If you lose it again,

377
23:33.990 --> 23:35.450
I'll make your mystical flower wither.

378
23:37.070 --> 23:38.530
So the source you mentioned is here?

379
23:40.400 --> 23:41.890
This water looks so ordinary.

380
23:41.960 --> 23:43.690
How could it have such amazing powers?

381
23:45.710 --> 23:46.940
This is Peach Blossom Paradise,

382
23:47.030 --> 23:48.620
created by the Saintess of the Tides a thousand years ago.

383
23:49.440 --> 23:50.180
This river

384
23:50.710 --> 23:51.940
is actually the entrance to the hidden realm.

385
23:54.990 --> 23:56.290
Mount Zhaowu has existed for generations.

386
23:57.120 --> 23:58.420
Why have we never heard of this place?

387
23:59.120 --> 23:59.900
Peach Blossom Paradise

388
24:00.160 --> 24:01.420
is unlike the mortal world.

389
24:01.960 --> 24:02.950
It's a separate realm

390
24:02.950 --> 24:03.860
hidden away from the rest of the world.

391
24:05.070 --> 24:05.690
Miss Yamao,

392
24:06.710 --> 24:07.660
you've lost too much blood and vital energy.

393
24:08.030 --> 24:08.860
Your body can't recover on its own.

394
24:09.440 --> 24:10.340
If the water from that well

395
24:10.640 --> 24:11.730
could ease your condition,

396
24:12.470 --> 24:13.660
then reaching the true source

397
24:14.160 --> 24:15.380
should cure you completely.

398
24:15.680 --> 24:17.180
Then how do we open the entrance?

399
24:17.640 --> 24:19.140
When the first light of dawn appears,

400
24:19.750 --> 24:20.770
direct the sunlight onto the river.

401
24:21.960 --> 24:22.820
That will open the barrier.

402
24:25.550 --> 24:26.530
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

403
24:27.030 --> 24:28.730
I was just desperate at the time.

404
24:28.990 --> 24:29.860
That's why I lashed out and hit you.

405
24:30.750 --> 24:31.820
I'm really sorry.

406
24:32.920 --> 24:33.420
It's all right.

407
24:34.840 --> 24:36.340
This all happened because of me.

408
24:37.030 --> 24:38.250
I was so focused on finding the source

409
24:39.160 --> 24:40.420
that I neglected Xiangyuan.

410
24:41.360 --> 24:42.770
It's too late for regrets now.

411
25:04.550 --> 25:05.820
Xiangyuan is saying goodbye to you.

412
25:07.600 --> 25:08.210
She says

413
25:08.680 --> 25:09.620
you have a kind heart.

414
25:11.230 --> 25:12.420
She wouldn't say that

415
25:13.360 --> 25:14.420
if she knew who I really was.

416
25:15.920 --> 25:17.210
A name is just a name.

417
25:38.120 --> 25:40.660
This jade pendant can turn you human.

418
25:41.440 --> 25:42.180
What are you doing?

419
25:42.710 --> 25:44.380
I'm the last surviving member

420
25:44.990 --> 25:45.940
of my master's lineage.

421
25:46.920 --> 25:48.010
I've lived alone on the mountain for years.

422
25:48.440 --> 25:49.290
Xiangyuan sensed

423
25:49.310 --> 25:49.940
how lonely I was.

424
25:50.550 --> 25:51.940
That's why she was determined to take human form and keep me company.

425
25:52.470 --> 25:53.900
Even when she was just a little rabbit,

426
25:54.710 --> 25:55.660
she was timid and sensitive.

427
25:56.600 --> 25:57.340
And now,

428
25:58.120 --> 25:59.490
how could I leave her all alone?

429
26:00.790 --> 26:01.780
If she can't take human form

430
26:01.780 --> 26:02.420
to be with me,

431
26:04.360 --> 26:07.800
then I'll become an animal to stay by her side.

432
26:09.960 --> 26:10.420
Everyone,

433
26:12.160 --> 26:12.900
until we meet again.

434
26:28.960 --> 26:30.820
Their love runs so deep

435
26:31.790 --> 26:33.290
that he'd even give up his humanity for her.

436
26:42.840 --> 26:43.530
Yamao.

437
26:44.990 --> 26:47.050
I'd like to speak with you alone.

438
26:47.470 --> 26:48.420
He wants to take your herb core.

439
26:51.160 --> 26:51.580
No.

440
26:52.790 --> 26:53.690
That's not what I meant.

441
26:54.360 --> 26:55.210
If he wanted to kill me,

442
26:55.440 --> 26:56.380
he would've done it long ago.

443
26:57.360 --> 26:59.140
If you two have something to discuss, take it elsewhere.

444
27:07.120 --> 27:08.250
I used spiritual power and well water

445
27:08.790 --> 27:09.580
to make some medicine.

446
27:10.750 --> 27:11.900
I'm nowhere near as skilled as you,

447
27:12.790 --> 27:13.790
but if

448
27:13.790 --> 27:15.310
you can't find the source in time

449
27:15.600 --> 27:16.660
and your blood and energy run low,

450
27:16.990 --> 27:17.820
this should help in an emergency.

451
27:20.710 --> 27:21.900
You're not coming with us?

452
27:24.120 --> 27:25.010
I came down from the mountain,

453
27:25.990 --> 27:26.860
but I failed to complete

454
27:26.880 --> 27:27.690
the task my master gave me.

455
27:28.510 --> 27:29.730
I'll return to Mount Zhaowu to face my punishment.

456
27:31.160 --> 27:31.770
Yamao,

457
27:32.790 --> 27:34.050
I won't reveal where you're going.

458
27:34.880 --> 27:35.900
I know you have your reasons

459
27:36.710 --> 27:37.690
for trying to save High Immortal Danshen.

460
27:38.470 --> 27:39.490
But Qi Fengyin

461
27:39.710 --> 27:40.820
will eventually become the Devil Incarnate

462
27:41.310 --> 27:42.010
and bring chaos to the world.

463
27:42.120 --> 27:43.580
Yet what he did for Xiangyuan

464
27:44.600 --> 27:45.490
makes me think

465
27:46.550 --> 27:47.820
the future isn't set in stone.

466
27:48.230 --> 27:48.940
I know I can't change your mind.

467
27:50.400 --> 27:51.620
If you insist on traveling with him,

468
27:52.200 --> 27:53.770
I only hope you'll stay true to yourself

469
27:54.360 --> 27:55.250
and won't fall under his influence.

470
27:57.920 --> 27:58.380
Take care.

471
27:59.030 --> 28:00.490
You stood up for me

472
28:00.680 --> 28:01.490
in front of those two cultivators.

473
28:01.710 --> 28:02.580
By now, the entire immortal realm

474
28:02.600 --> 28:03.580
must know

475
28:03.790 --> 28:04.860
you've betrayed your sect.

476
28:05.230 --> 28:06.530
You'll definitely be punished if you go back.

477
28:06.990 --> 28:07.530
Why don't you

478
28:07.920 --> 28:09.100
come with us instead?

479
28:12.840 --> 28:14.340
You and Qi Fengyin keep each other in check

480
28:14.600 --> 28:15.380
as you travel together.

481
28:16.470 --> 28:17.490
But Qi Fengyin and I...

482
28:18.790 --> 28:20.140
We stand on opposite sides of good and evil.

483
28:21.310 --> 28:22.210
One day,

484
28:23.550 --> 28:24.660
I'll kill Qi Fengyin.

485
28:26.030 --> 28:27.250
That's a problem for another day.

486
28:27.270 --> 28:28.130
We'll deal with it later.

487
28:28.600 --> 28:29.260
For now,

488
28:29.260 --> 28:30.250
just come with us until things calm down.

489
28:30.680 --> 28:30.940
Come on.

490
28:37.880 --> 28:39.900
You don't want to come with us.

491
28:40.640 --> 28:41.380
Could it be

492
28:41.400 --> 28:42.180
that you're embarrassed?

493
28:43.310 --> 28:44.210
Because of

494
28:45.030 --> 28:45.490
this?

495
28:45.510 --> 28:45.940
You're...

496
28:46.880 --> 28:47.580
You're reading too much into it.

497
28:50.120 --> 28:51.050
I know.

498
28:51.440 --> 28:53.380
For Mount Zhaowu disciples,

499
28:53.400 --> 28:54.140
a spiritual mark means a great deal.

500
28:54.440 --> 28:55.940
It's not just a sign of cultivation.

501
28:56.070 --> 28:58.140
It also represents your purity...

502
28:58.160 --> 28:58.580
Enough.

503
28:59.640 --> 29:00.420
There's no need to bring up

504
29:00.600 --> 29:01.580
how you took my spiritual mark.

505
29:04.470 --> 29:04.970
Actually,

506
29:06.200 --> 29:07.490
it's not what you think.

507
29:14.750 --> 29:16.100
The scholars at Mount Zhaowu say

508
29:17.270 --> 29:19.420
only physical intimacy breaks that vow.

509
29:19.600 --> 29:20.420
All I did was take

510
29:20.440 --> 29:21.180
Youyou's doll

511
29:21.470 --> 29:22.970
and rub it against your spiritual mark.

512
29:23.640 --> 29:24.420
Which means

513
29:24.840 --> 29:25.770
your purity is still intact.

514
29:26.470 --> 29:27.620
Was it really that easy

515
29:28.600 --> 29:29.450
to take my spiritual mark?

516
29:30.230 --> 29:32.120
Then perhaps you should tell me,

517
29:32.120 --> 29:33.910
Hao, what exactly were you dreaming about?

518
29:34.640 --> 29:36.210
Why was your faith so easily shaken?

519
29:36.920 --> 29:37.490
Ridiculous.

520
29:48.750 --> 29:50.490
How dare you take Hao's spiritual mark!

521
29:50.840 --> 29:51.770
You must die!

522
29:52.160 --> 29:52.620
Yinhua!

523
29:54.200 --> 29:54.660
Stop.

524
29:56.360 --> 29:57.140
What are you thinking?

525
29:59.840 --> 30:01.380
Master ordered you to take her herb core.

526
30:01.550 --> 30:03.100
Every sect knows about it.

527
30:03.470 --> 30:04.180
By doing this,

528
30:04.510 --> 30:06.050
are you really going to defy Master

529
30:06.200 --> 30:07.180
and betray our sect?

530
30:07.440 --> 30:08.210
That's my concern.

531
30:09.470 --> 30:10.820
I'll return to Mount Zhaowu and face my punishment.

532
30:13.840 --> 30:14.580
I'll just assume

533
30:15.840 --> 30:17.210
that demon girl has bewitched you.

534
30:20.960 --> 30:21.580
Yinhua!

535
30:27.840 --> 30:28.290
Yinhua.

536
30:48.670 --> 30:49.420
Stop! Both of you!

537
30:49.440 --> 30:50.690
Please, for my sake!

538
30:51.960 --> 30:53.010
You're nothing but a lowly herb spirit!

539
30:53.270 --> 30:54.080
Who do you think you are?

540
30:54.080 --> 30:55.450
I went out of my way to save you,

541
30:55.470 --> 30:56.250
despite everything you've done.

542
30:56.550 --> 30:57.540
And you don't even appreciate it.

543
30:57.960 --> 30:58.860
If you want to die, go ahead!

544
30:59.160 --> 31:00.000
Qi Fengyin, get them!

545
31:08.540 --> 31:09.100
Go on.

546
31:10.840 --> 31:11.900
Why should I listen to you?

547
31:14.710 --> 31:16.450
Didn't you just want to kill them?

548
31:16.750 --> 31:18.180
That doesn't mean you get to order me around.

549
31:20.230 --> 31:20.940
We've saved each other's lives

550
31:20.990 --> 31:21.860
more times than I can count.

551
31:21.990 --> 31:22.820
They're outsiders.

552
31:22.840 --> 31:23.940
Can't you just back me up for once?

553
31:24.510 --> 31:25.970
If I do everything you say,

554
31:26.030 --> 31:26.970
what happens to my dignity?

555
31:28.750 --> 31:29.250
Yamao.

556
31:30.640 --> 31:31.490
Everything I've done on this journey

557
31:32.400 --> 31:33.580
has betrayed my sect.

558
31:34.310 --> 31:35.180
The next time we meet,

559
31:36.270 --> 31:37.180
I won't show you any mercy.

560
31:37.790 --> 31:38.820
You and Qi Fengyin

561
31:40.360 --> 31:41.340
had better watch yourselves.

562
31:44.550 --> 31:45.010
Hao.

563
31:45.750 --> 31:46.420
What about her herb core?

564
31:55.920 --> 31:57.250
I know what I'm doing.

565
31:58.030 --> 31:59.450
Thank you for sparing my life, Hao.

566
32:19.270 --> 32:19.940
What are you looking at?

567
32:22.310 --> 32:24.860
When you faced Xiangyuan alone,

568
32:25.550 --> 32:26.620
you barely had any magical power left.

569
32:27.070 --> 32:28.250
How did you manage to restrain her?

570
32:28.400 --> 32:30.100
And it's not like you're

571
32:30.100 --> 32:31.070
much of a talker.

572
32:31.470 --> 32:32.310
So how did you manage

573
32:32.310 --> 32:33.180
to free her from her obsession?

574
32:34.990 --> 32:36.140
I have my ways.

575
32:37.230 --> 32:38.940
I don't have to tell you everything.

576
32:44.750 --> 32:45.730
What exactly are you up to?

577
32:48.400 --> 32:50.290
I've been thinking about the past few days.

578
32:50.840 --> 32:52.050
You know, Xiangyuan

579
32:52.600 --> 32:53.590
didn't even know

580
32:53.590 --> 32:54.530
you were the source of all evil.

581
32:55.600 --> 32:57.040
She'd never heard

582
32:57.230 --> 32:58.660
what people say about you.

583
33:00.360 --> 33:01.140
All she saw

584
33:02.250 --> 33:03.570
was who you really are.

585
33:03.750 --> 33:05.180
Even after she became a little rabbit,

586
33:05.310 --> 33:06.360
she still wanted to be close to you.

587
33:06.990 --> 33:07.940
That's why I think

588
33:09.230 --> 33:11.250
you're not the bloodthirsty monster everyone claims.

589
33:13.030 --> 33:14.190
What's it to you?

590
33:22.310 --> 33:23.450
We were having a nice conversation.

591
33:23.710 --> 33:25.200
Why do you suddenly want to water the mystical flower?

592
33:25.200 --> 33:26.620
How about we wait

593
33:26.840 --> 33:27.970
until we've collected all the malice,

594
33:28.310 --> 33:29.180
then water the flower

595
33:29.400 --> 33:29.860
all at once?

596
33:30.400 --> 33:31.140
No.

597
33:31.990 --> 33:32.780
This is the only way

598
33:33.200 --> 33:35.360
to maintain my connection with the mystical flower.

599
33:35.840 --> 33:37.790
But if we keep doing this,

600
33:37.960 --> 33:39.010
my body can't take it.

601
33:39.400 --> 33:39.970
How about we wait

602
33:40.440 --> 33:41.970
until we find the source of the well water,

603
33:42.070 --> 33:43.380
then water the flower?

604
33:51.710 --> 33:53.210
You won't die as long as I'm here.

605
34:01.680 --> 34:02.660
Qi Fengyin!

606
34:03.710 --> 34:04.770
And here I thought

607
34:05.270 --> 34:06.490
you could be a good person.

608
34:12.880 --> 34:13.760
You don't seem

609
34:13.760 --> 34:15.350
to have lost your mind to dark energy.

610
34:15.760 --> 34:16.880
Why would you say something so ridiculous?

611
34:18.030 --> 34:18.900
I didn't do any of this

612
34:18.900 --> 34:19.970
for Xiangyuan.

613
34:20.550 --> 34:21.610
Why would that change how you see me?

614
34:22.280 --> 34:23.190
Right, right.

615
34:23.630 --> 34:24.610
Everything you do

616
34:24.800 --> 34:25.900
is for the mystical flower.

617
34:27.550 --> 34:28.530
You care about it so much,

618
34:28.840 --> 34:30.130
yet you claim it's not precious to you.

619
34:34.240 --> 34:35.010
Fine, I won't bring it up.

620
34:35.440 --> 34:36.170
Why the long face?

621
34:41.990 --> 34:42.860
This mystical flower

622
34:44.150 --> 34:45.570
is a woman's spirit.

623
34:47.800 --> 34:48.970
But I'm not trying to bring her back

624
34:50.590 --> 34:52.170
because I love her.

625
34:54.400 --> 34:55.300
Then why?

626
34:59.110 --> 35:00.530
Because I want to kill her myself.

627
35:04.720 --> 35:06.740
I remember nothing

628
35:06.760 --> 35:08.260
from before I was sealed on Mount Qihuang

629
35:09.630 --> 35:10.530
a thousand years ago.

630
35:11.470 --> 35:13.260
But there's one woman I do remember.

631
35:16.630 --> 35:18.610
She tortured me for a thousand years.

632
35:25.670 --> 35:27.450
Even the Saintess of the Tides exhausted her divine power

633
35:27.960 --> 35:29.300
just to seal him away.

634
35:30.030 --> 35:31.860
This woman must be even more powerful than the Saintess

635
35:32.470 --> 35:33.820
to have tortured Qi Fengyin.

636
35:34.110 --> 35:35.530
Through a thousand years of endless torment,

637
35:36.630 --> 35:37.820
she repeatedly

638
35:38.320 --> 35:40.050
tore my body apart.

639
35:40.880 --> 35:42.970
Then she healed me completely,

640
35:44.720 --> 35:46.940
only to torture me all over again.

641
35:47.320 --> 35:48.610
So even though I've forgotten

642
35:48.630 --> 35:50.010
everything else from those thousand years,

643
35:50.280 --> 35:51.610
I'll never forget

644
35:53.030 --> 35:55.130
all the pain she put me through.

645
35:57.550 --> 35:58.900
Even though she's dead,

646
36:00.990 --> 36:02.380
I'll nurture this mystical flower

647
36:02.400 --> 36:03.340
until she takes form again.

648
36:04.550 --> 36:06.260
Then I'll kill her with my own hands.

649
36:06.470 --> 36:07.900
You and I have different goals.

650
36:08.400 --> 36:09.530
You're going to save someone.

651
36:11.510 --> 36:12.820
I'm going to kill someone.

652
36:15.190 --> 36:16.970
So stop expecting anything good from me.

653
36:29.880 --> 36:30.900
I wonder if Cheng Kong

654
36:30.920 --> 36:31.700
was telling us the truth.

655
36:32.070 --> 36:33.610
He's never even been to Peach Blossom Paradise.

656
36:33.840 --> 36:34.650
It's almost dawn.

657
37:05.510 --> 37:06.420
Qi... Qi Fengyin!

658
37:06.510 --> 37:07.220
I can see it.

659
37:08.760 --> 37:09.220
Let's go.

660
37:13.880 --> 37:15.040
Youyou! Youyou!

661
37:15.800 --> 37:16.740
What is it? What's wrong?

662
37:21.580 --> 37:23.860
[Mount Zhaowu]

663
37:26.920 --> 37:28.300
Master treats you like his own son.

664
37:28.720 --> 37:29.810
Are you really going to

665
37:29.810 --> 37:30.740
defy his orders

666
37:31.190 --> 37:32.180
for a mere herb spirit?

667
37:34.440 --> 37:35.820
My answer hasn't changed

668
37:36.150 --> 37:36.970
since the last time we spoke.

669
37:37.840 --> 37:38.740
Is it because she

670
37:38.760 --> 37:39.700
took your spiritual mark

671
37:39.990 --> 37:41.170
that you're so determined to protect her?

672
37:46.470 --> 37:48.090
You eavesdropped on our conversation?

673
37:49.400 --> 37:50.820
Why won't you talk about it?

674
37:50.990 --> 37:51.940
For a Mount Zhaowu disciple,

675
37:51.960 --> 37:53.780
losing a spiritual mark is like losing one's purity.

676
37:53.960 --> 37:54.420
Hao...

677
37:54.440 --> 37:54.860
Yinhua.

678
37:58.360 --> 37:59.490
I spoke out of turn

679
37:59.920 --> 38:00.860
because I lost my temper.

680
38:02.440 --> 38:03.260
I was wrong.

681
38:04.590 --> 38:05.340
What happened with my spiritual mark

682
38:06.070 --> 38:07.530
was just an unfortunate misunderstanding.

683
38:07.920 --> 38:08.900
There's nothing

684
38:09.320 --> 38:10.340
between Yamao and me.

685
38:10.720 --> 38:11.650
My decision to defy Master

686
38:12.400 --> 38:13.170
has nothing to do with her.

687
38:14.320 --> 38:15.050
Even if it had been

688
38:15.070 --> 38:15.900
someone other than Yamao,

689
38:16.800 --> 38:17.700
I would've done the same.

690
38:17.920 --> 38:18.340
Hao...

691
38:18.550 --> 38:19.260
Besides,

692
38:21.070 --> 38:22.090
before returning to the mountain,

693
38:22.630 --> 38:24.260
I rescued Yamao

694
38:24.320 --> 38:25.260
from two immortal sect disciples.

695
38:25.720 --> 38:26.860
Word that I've betrayed the immortal sects

696
38:27.280 --> 38:28.900
has probably spread throughout every sect by now.

697
38:29.720 --> 38:30.340
That can't be.

698
38:30.670 --> 38:31.260
Hao.

699
38:31.360 --> 38:31.900
Yinhua.

700
38:33.070 --> 38:33.610
Hao.

701
38:34.110 --> 38:35.170
Master sent me to welcome you back.

702
38:35.800 --> 38:37.490
Did your journey go well?

703
38:40.630 --> 38:41.730
Why didn't you bring

704
38:41.730 --> 38:42.450
Yamao back?

705
38:42.960 --> 38:44.100
Couldn't you find her?

706
38:45.400 --> 38:46.090
Before we returned,

707
38:46.630 --> 38:47.450
did any immortal sect disciples

708
38:47.470 --> 38:48.300
come to see Master?

709
38:49.440 --> 38:49.970
No, none.

710
38:50.670 --> 38:51.600
If anyone had come to visit,

711
38:52.080 --> 38:53.000
they would've had to go through me.

712
38:54.070 --> 38:55.330
Could those disciples

713
38:56.110 --> 38:57.530
have kept this from Master?

714
39:00.440 --> 39:01.530
You found her,

715
39:03.000 --> 39:04.190
but you let her go?

716
39:04.400 --> 39:05.090
Master,

717
39:06.470 --> 39:07.300
I know I was wrong.

718
39:08.110 --> 39:08.970
Master, please hear me out.

719
39:09.150 --> 39:10.780
This is all Yamao's fault.

720
39:10.990 --> 39:12.340
That demon girl has betrayed the immortal realm

721
39:12.440 --> 39:13.860
and is under the protection of Qi Fengyin, that devil.

722
39:13.990 --> 39:15.780
That's why Hao couldn't carry out your orders.

723
39:16.190 --> 39:16.700
Hao.

724
39:18.590 --> 39:19.050
Is that true?

725
39:19.320 --> 39:20.700
Even without Qi Fengyin's protection,

726
39:21.150 --> 39:21.650
I still

727
39:22.400 --> 39:24.170
wouldn't take Yamao's herb core.

728
39:32.720 --> 39:33.970
Ever since you joined Mount Zhaowu,

729
39:34.840 --> 39:36.570
you've never disobeyed me.

730
39:37.760 --> 39:38.740
Why now?

731
39:40.630 --> 39:41.420
I'd like to ask you something, too.

732
39:42.920 --> 39:43.970
Why must we kill her

733
39:44.670 --> 39:45.900
to save the world?

734
39:47.800 --> 39:48.420
She only took human form

735
39:48.670 --> 39:50.130
because she received a wisp

736
39:50.150 --> 39:50.940
of the Saintess's divine power.

737
39:51.960 --> 39:52.940
Now we're simply

738
39:53.190 --> 39:55.090
returning that power to its rightful owner.

739
39:55.440 --> 39:56.900
Yamao became a spirit through that divine power.

740
39:57.840 --> 39:59.260
That was her own good fortune.

741
39:59.630 --> 40:00.610
She owes no one anything.

742
40:00.880 --> 40:02.130
And she's done nothing wrong.

743
40:02.510 --> 40:04.010
Why should she give up her core?

744
40:04.670 --> 40:05.610
Even if that power must be returned,

745
40:06.190 --> 40:07.780
the Saintess herself should ask for it.

746
40:07.920 --> 40:08.420
Hao.

747
40:11.510 --> 40:12.170
I'm giving you

748
40:12.670 --> 40:14.170
one last chance.

749
40:15.320 --> 40:17.650
Where did Yamao and Qi Fengyin go?

750
40:33.660 --> 40:34.410
Fine.

751
40:36.480 --> 40:37.500
So this is the disciple

752
40:37.500 --> 40:38.970
I, Du Zhong, raised myself!

753
40:39.400 --> 40:40.340
I've clearly

754
40:40.360 --> 40:41.570
praised your talent too much over the years.

755
40:42.110 --> 40:43.610
Now you think you're above everyone else.

756
40:44.670 --> 40:45.490
In that case,

757
40:46.280 --> 40:48.260
you'll go to the lowest level of Wuchang Prison

758
40:49.510 --> 40:50.860
and spend some time there

759
40:50.880 --> 40:51.610
strengthening your resolve.

760
40:53.110 --> 40:53.740
Master!

761
40:54.150 --> 40:55.260
The lowest level of Wuchang Prison

762
40:55.360 --> 40:56.130
is reserved

763
40:56.150 --> 40:57.380
for our sect's worst offenders.

764
40:57.630 --> 40:58.300
But Hao

765
40:58.440 --> 40:59.260
has done nothing to deserve that.

766
40:59.400 --> 41:01.380
And that place is bitterly cold,

767
41:01.630 --> 41:02.380
with such intense dark energy

768
41:02.400 --> 41:03.340
that it could destroy his cultivation foundation.

769
41:03.550 --> 41:05.010
Master, please reconsider.

770
41:06.920 --> 41:08.740
Once he's come to his senses

771
41:09.760 --> 41:11.170
and tells me where Yamao is,

772
41:11.550 --> 41:12.420
only then

773
41:12.960 --> 41:14.340
will he leave Wuchang Prison.

774
41:15.150 --> 41:15.690
I

775
41:17.510 --> 41:18.300
accept my punishment.

776
41:20.340 --> 41:24.100
[Wuchang Prison]

777
41:27.400 --> 41:27.940
Hao.

778
41:29.550 --> 41:30.820
Even if you refuse to kill Yamao,

779
41:31.840 --> 41:32.650
countless others want her dead

780
41:32.670 --> 41:34.210
so they can take her herb core.

781
41:34.710 --> 41:36.130
Why defy Master over this?

782
41:37.190 --> 41:37.980
I've made up my mind.

783
41:46.920 --> 41:47.940
The cold here cuts right to the bone.

784
41:48.710 --> 41:49.420
If this continues,

785
41:50.000 --> 41:51.090
your cultivation foundation

786
41:51.440 --> 41:52.340
will be badly damaged.

787
41:52.630 --> 41:53.690
Is it really worth it?

788
42:18.860 --> 42:22.380
[Peach Blossom Paradise]

789
42:31.400 --> 42:32.820
This place is full of foul energy.

790
42:32.960 --> 42:33.940
What a disappointment.

791
42:34.280 --> 42:36.260
And they call this a paradise?

792
42:36.670 --> 42:37.570
Cheng Kong is such a liar.

793
42:37.960 --> 42:39.420
But Cheng Kong had no reason to lie to us.

794
42:40.280 --> 42:42.010
Could it be that the Saintess hasn't awakened,

795
42:42.590 --> 42:43.860
and this entire realm

796
42:43.880 --> 42:44.690
is dying along with her?

797
42:46.510 --> 42:47.300
Where's Qi Fengyin?

798
42:47.760 --> 42:49.010
Did we get separated?

799
42:49.230 --> 42:50.090
Yamao.

800
42:51.190 --> 42:52.530
I'm so dizzy.

801
42:54.880 --> 42:55.610
This foul energy

802
42:55.960 --> 42:56.980
is draining our spiritual power.

803
42:57.800 --> 42:58.530
Let's get out of here.

804
43:14.230 --> 43:14.690
Follow me.

805
43:23.710 --> 43:24.780
How did you get in here?

806
43:25.230 --> 43:26.460
Outsiders can't enter this place.

807
43:26.840 --> 43:27.490
If it weren't for me,

808
43:27.800 --> 43:29.130
you'd be nothing but bones by now.

809
43:30.190 --> 43:30.980
Outsiders?

810
43:32.360 --> 43:33.380
You live here in the Peach Blossom Paradise?

811
43:34.670 --> 43:35.530
Just call me Yuanbao.

812
43:36.110 --> 43:36.610
Miss,

813
43:36.960 --> 43:38.090
do you know

814
43:38.130 --> 43:39.490
what happened to this place?

815
43:39.960 --> 43:40.980
And that dragon's roar earlier...

816
43:41.280 --> 43:42.090
What was that?

817
43:42.190 --> 43:42.940
This foul energy

818
43:43.230 --> 43:44.570
is the breath of an ancient black dragon.

819
43:45.030 --> 43:45.900
I'm out of arrows.

820
43:46.150 --> 43:46.860
Don't draw it over here.

821
43:47.280 --> 43:47.980
A black dragon?

822
43:48.400 --> 43:49.570
The one we encountered before?

823
43:51.480 --> 43:52.010
That's right.

824
43:52.960 --> 43:53.690
This paradise

825
43:53.840 --> 43:55.090
was once a sacred sanctuary

826
43:55.110 --> 43:55.900
created by the Saintess.

827
43:56.440 --> 43:57.530
But that vile black dragon

828
43:57.550 --> 43:58.530
snuck in when it was vulnerable,

829
43:58.760 --> 43:59.820
devouring its inhabitants

830
44:00.480 --> 44:01.570
and spreading this foul energy.

831
44:02.110 --> 44:03.050
Qi Fengyin is missing.

832
44:03.710 --> 44:04.820
What if this foul energy

833
44:04.840 --> 44:05.460
swallowed him up?

834
44:05.960 --> 44:06.860
What do we do?

835
44:07.590 --> 44:08.420
What are you doing?

836
44:09.070 --> 44:09.530
My Lord!

837
44:10.000 --> 44:11.340
Where did you go?

838
44:13.920 --> 44:15.210
I couldn't find either of you.

839
44:15.510 --> 44:17.050
I was searching for you while looking for the source.

840
44:19.000 --> 44:20.420
This paradise is filled with foul energy.

841
44:20.960 --> 44:22.490
How can you still wander around looking for people?

842
44:23.070 --> 44:24.210
And you don't have a scratch on you.

843
44:31.710 --> 44:32.780
The foul energy here is too strong.

844
44:33.070 --> 44:34.210
The source is probably ruined, too.

845
44:34.480 --> 44:34.940
Let's go back.

846
44:35.550 --> 44:36.050
But...

847
44:37.280 --> 44:38.940
The water from that well helped me.

848
44:39.440 --> 44:41.210
That means the source is still clean.

849
44:41.880 --> 44:42.860
Let's keep looking.

850
44:47.110 --> 44:47.610
Yamao.

851
44:49.190 --> 44:50.460
The mystical spring you're looking for...

852
44:51.070 --> 44:52.170
I think I know where it is.

853
44:53.000 --> 44:53.610
Take us there.

854
45:08.760 --> 45:09.820
But that vile black dragon

855
45:09.920 --> 45:11.340
wants to use our souls in a blood sacrifice.

856
45:11.480 --> 45:12.420
Please save us

857
45:12.590 --> 45:13.610
and slay the black dragon!

858
45:14.400 --> 45:15.010
My Lord!

859
45:15.230 --> 45:15.980
Qi Fengyin!

860
45:16.960 --> 45:17.650
Qi Fengyin!

861
45:17.880 --> 45:18.650
If I kill him,

862
45:18.880 --> 45:20.610
the immortal sects won't need to sacrifice me

863
45:20.800 --> 45:22.170
to awaken the Saintess of the Tides.

864
45:22.400 --> 45:23.340
Master will be saved,

865
45:23.760 --> 45:24.980
and the mystical flower won't keep me

866
45:25.000 --> 45:26.380
bound to Qi Fengyin anymore.

867
45:47.140 --> 45:51.180
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

868
45:51.420 --> 45:54.860
♪So many longings♪

869
45:55.540 --> 45:57.620
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

870
45:57.820 --> 46:02.820
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

871
46:03.740 --> 46:07.780
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

872
46:08.020 --> 46:11.460
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

873
46:12.140 --> 46:14.220
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

874
46:14.420 --> 46:21.820
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

875
46:23.220 --> 46:26.900
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

876
46:27.140 --> 46:30.820
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

877
46:31.460 --> 46:35.020
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

878
46:35.340 --> 46:39.500
♪Still waits to come true♪

879
46:39.740 --> 46:43.420
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

880
46:43.980 --> 46:47.620
♪I'll stay by your side♪

881
46:48.100 --> 46:51.700
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

882
46:51.940 --> 46:59.260
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

883
47:12.740 --> 47:16.780
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

884
47:17.020 --> 47:20.460
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

885
47:21.140 --> 47:23.220
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

886
47:23.380 --> 47:30.820
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

887
47:31.740 --> 47:35.420
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

888
47:36.020 --> 47:39.620
♪I'll stay by your side♪

889
47:40.140 --> 47:43.700
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

890
47:43.940 --> 47:51.260
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
